OL,3,ATV presenter among 11 sentenced to
OL,4,Adeath in Egypt drugs case
OL,5,
OL,6,FKhalifa, 39, is best known for her TV
OL,7,Fprogramme Mission Impossible which
OL,8,Fdealt with crime issues. She has denied
OL,9,Fthe charges.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
